# V2-10 (f) the seas and coasts on the huge planet of seed 7, each at a place in its realm (`x=`,
# `z=`): a kelp forest under the North Atlantic with a harbour seal and cod; an Indo-Pacific reef
# from above and below with its turtles, shark, grouper and parrotfish; a northern beach with seals
# and seabirds; the Arctic's ice with a polar bear, ringed seals and walruses; the Antarctic's with
# emperor and Adélie penguins; the open ocean with whales and dolphins; the mangroves of the
# Americas and Asia on their stilt roots; coconut palms on a tropical beach; the deep ocean's floor
# lit by its glowing sea pens; a salt marsh and dunes; then the sea's animals, close.
# `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/v210_oceans.shots`
